{
  "id": "p01",
  "title": "A Saturday by the River",
  "titleZh": "河边的星期六",
  "topic": "日常",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "My son talks about baseball all through a slow Saturday breakfast.",
        "zh": "那个慢悠悠的星期六早餐，我儿子一直在聊棒球。"
      },
      {
        "en": "During his summer course, he learns to catch, throw, run.",
        "zh": "在暑期课程里，他学着接球、投球、跑垒。"
      },
      {
        "en": "At fourteen, he practices with a quiet sort of steady joy.",
        "zh": "十四岁的他，练习时带着一种安静的、稳稳的欢喜。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My daughter is small, but she wants to play that same game too.",
        "zh": "我女儿还小，可她也想玩同一场比赛。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Her little club meets near an old university gate on Saturdays.",
        "zh": "她的小俱乐部每周六在老大学门口附近集合。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Our whole group meets for an hour every sunny Saturday morning.",
        "zh": "我们整组人每个晴朗的星期六早上集合一小时。"
      },
      {
        "en": "By now they know almost every step of that long game.",
        "zh": "到这时，他们几乎熟悉了这场漫长比赛的每一步。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then a lady phones about a car parked outside our house.",
        "zh": "这时一位女士打来电话，说我们屋外停着一辆车。"
      },
      {
        "en": "It is expensive, and it blocks our narrow street all day.",
        "zh": "那车很贵，而且一整天堵着我们狭窄的街道。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "We suppose she will lock it and move it soon.",
        "zh": "我们猜她很快就会把车锁好开走。"
      },
      {
        "en": "She has rich taste in art, or so we often hear.",
        "zh": "她对艺术很有品味，或者说我们常听人这么讲。"
      },
      {
        "en": "She cannot afford a new unit for that old car today.",
        "zh": "今天她付不起那辆旧车的新部件。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We hope she will not spend too much money on repairs.",
        "zh": "我们希望她别在修理上花太多钱。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Our afternoon continues as the children develop a careful plan.",
        "zh": "下午继续过去，孩子们拟出一个周密的计划。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A wide river runs slowly past our small quiet town.",
        "zh": "一条宽阔的河从我们安静的小镇旁缓缓流过。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We walk over an old stone footbridge to rest on grass.",
        "zh": "我们走过一座旧石人行桥，到草地上休息。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A white sail drifts slowly by; water sits at peace.",
        "zh": "一张白帆缓缓漂过；水面一片平静。"
      },
      {
        "en": "One little boat swings gently under a pale evening moon.",
        "zh": "一只小船在苍白的晚月下轻轻摇晃。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Her silly little pet jumps at every single passing ocean wave.",
        "zh": "她那傻乎乎的小宠物见到每一道海浪都要跳。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A tired brown dog gently puts its head on my knee.",
        "zh": "一只疲倦的棕狗轻轻把头搁在我的膝盖上。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Its warm neck carries a weight I can barely even feel.",
        "zh": "它温热的脖子驮着一份我几乎感觉不到的重量。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "A wrong turn leads us to a tiny village fair.",
        "zh": "一个错误的转弯把我们带到一个小小的乡村集市。"
      },
      {
        "en": "He buys a bitter drink there with a promise to pay later.",
        "zh": "他在那里买了一杯苦味的饮料，说好晚些付钱。"
      },
      {
        "en": "He tells a lie; a kind guest notices it at once.",
        "zh": "他撒了个谎；一位好心的客人立刻察觉了。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My favourite weekend job is to separate the two heavy boxes.",
        "zh": "我周末最喜欢干的活，就是把那两个沉重的箱子分开。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Two quick hands prevent a very bad accident that day.",
        "zh": "那天，两双快手阻止了一场很糟的事故。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Fear is a quiet enemy, so memory must calmly fight it.",
        "zh": "恐惧是一个安静的敌人，所以记忆必须平静地与它对抗。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later, that lady phones to fix a final morning appointment.",
        "zh": "后来，那位女士打来电话，约了一个最后的早晨时间。"
      }
    ]
  ],
